/-
OnBytes/Tie/Pv/Keeps/StillModel.lean: which routines of the verifier begin and close no round of the
view: 238 of the 397 routines of OnBytes/Iop/, OnBytes/Model/ and OnBytes/Proof/ that
OnBytes/Tie/Pv/Keeps/KeepsModel.lean walks.

Statements and proofs, made by the commands of OnBytes/Tie/Pv/Keeps/KeepsWalk.lean, one line for
each routine, in the order of the definitions. Inside this namespace KeepsM x reads: wherever x
succeeds, the round whose message is being received and the rounds that are not yet begun are as
they were (OnBytes/Tie/Pv/Keeps/StillKit.lean). keeps_had: the class is there already. keeps_walk:
the routine's text is unfolded and gone through. keeps_walk_fn: the same for a routine that is
written as a function of a state. keeps_walk_rec: by induction along the routine's own recursion.
The list was found by the command keeps_find of the same file. Through the other 159 routines the
commands did not get; nothing is said of them here, neither that they have the property nor that
they lack it.
Limits: those of OnBytes/Tie/Pv/Keeps/StillKit.lean. The statements in plain words are in
OnBytes/Tie/Pv/Keeps/StillRan.lean.
-/
